@guide A_Zangarmarsh
@name Zangarmarsh (Telredor)
@faction Alliance
@levels 61-64
@zone Zangarmarsh
@chapter Outland
@desc Cenarion Refuge, Telredor, Orebor Harborage and Sporeggar. The Coilfang Reservoir dungeons (Slave Pens, Underbog) are optional.
@next A_Terokkar

turnin The Cenarion Expedition [optional] | Ysiel Windsinger, if you took it in Hellfire.
accept Disturbance at Umbrafen Lake | Ysiel Windsinger.
accept The Umbrafen Tribe | Ikeyen, Cenarion Refuge.
complete The Umbrafen Tribe | Umbrafen kobolds at Umbrafen Lake (south).
complete Disturbance at Umbrafen Lake | Explore the pumping station.
turnin The Umbrafen Tribe
accept A Damp, Dark Place
accept Saving the Sporeloks
accept Plants of Zangarmarsh | Lauranna Thar'well.
complete Plants of Zangarmarsh [optional] | 10 Unidentified Plant Parts drop from Zangarmarsh creatures as you quest.
turnin Plants of Zangarmarsh [optional] | Lauranna Thar'well; hand in whenever you are back with 10 parts.
accept Blessings of the Ancients | Windcaller Blackhoof.
complete Blessings of the Ancients | Speak to the ancients Ashyen and Keleth, right here at the Refuge.
turnin Blessings of the Ancients
accept Safeguarding the Watchers
turnin Disturbance at Umbrafen Lake
accept As the Crow Flies | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
complete As the Crow Flies | Use the potion to fly the route.
turnin As the Crow Flies
accept Balance Must Be Preserved
accept Warden Hamoot
accept The Dying Balance | Lethyn Moonfire.
turnin Warden Hamoot
accept A Warm Welcome
complete A Warm Welcome | Mire Hydras.
complete A Damp, Dark Place | The Ikeyen's Belongings cave in Umbrafen.
complete Safeguarding the Watchers | Kill the Umbrafen Oracles and Seers.
complete Saving the Sporeloks
complete Balance Must Be Preserved | Shut down the pumps at Umbrafen Lake.
complete The Dying Balance | Elite: Boglash; bring help or skip.
turnin A Warm Welcome
turnin Safeguarding the Watchers
turnin A Damp, Dark Place
turnin Saving the Sporeloks
turnin The Dying Balance
turnin Balance Must Be Preserved
fp Cenarion Refuge
fp Telredor | Climb the giant mushroom at Telredor.
accept The Zapthrottle Mote Extractor! | K. Lee Smallfry.
bind Telredor [area=3644]
accept The Dead Mire | Vindicator Idaar.
accept The Orebor Harborage | Anchorite Ahuurn.
accept The Boha'mu Ruins | Anchorite Ahuurn.
accept Fulgor Spores | Ruam.
accept Too Many Mouths to Feed | Haalrun.
accept Menacing Marshfangs | Noraani.
complete Menacing Marshfangs | Marshfang Rippers.
complete Too Many Mouths to Feed
complete Fulgor Spores | Fulgor spores on mushrooms around Telredor.
complete The Dead Mire | The soil sample in the Dead Mire (east).
complete The Boha'mu Ruins | Explore the Boha'mu Ruins.
turnin Menacing Marshfangs
accept Umbrafen Eel Filets
complete Umbrafen Eel Filets | Eel Filet drops from Umbrafen Eel.
turnin Umbrafen Eel Filets
turnin Too Many Mouths to Feed
accept Diaphanous Wings
complete Diaphanous Wings | Diaphanous Wing drops from Blacksting, Marshlight Bleeder and Umbraglow Stinger and others.
turnin Diaphanous Wings
turnin Fulgor Spores
turnin The Boha'mu Ruins
accept Idols of the Feralfen
complete Idols of the Feralfen | Feralfen Ruins idols.
turnin Idols of the Feralfen
accept Gathering the Reagents
complete Gathering the Reagents | Spore Bat Eye drops from Greater Sporebat, Sporebat and Sporewing and others. Fen Strider Tentacle drops from Boglash and Fen Strider.
turnin Gathering the Reagents
accept Messenger to the Feralfen
complete Messenger to the Feralfen
turnin Messenger to the Feralfen
turnin The Dead Mire
accept An Unnatural Drought
complete An Unnatural Drought | Withered giants in the Dead Mire.
turnin An Unnatural Drought
turnin The Zapthrottle Mote Extractor! [optional]
accept Watcher Leesa'oh | From Lethyn Moonfire.
accept The Sporelings' Plight | Fahssn.
accept Natural Enemies
turnin Watcher Leesa'oh | Watcher Leesa'oh, near Sporeggar.
accept Observing the Sporelings
complete Observing the Sporelings
complete The Sporelings' Plight | Mature Spore Sacs on the ground.
complete Natural Enemies | Bog Lord Tendril drops from Bog Lord, Starving Fungal Giant and Withered Giant and others.
turnin Observing the Sporelings
accept A Question of Gluttony
complete A Question of Gluttony | Discarded Nutriment: loot Discarded Nutriment.
turnin A Question of Gluttony
accept Familiar Fungi
complete Familiar Fungi | Mushroom Sample drops from Ango'rosh Ogre, Ango'rosh Shaman and Boss Grog'ak and others.
turnin Familiar Fungi
turnin The Sporelings' Plight
turnin Natural Enemies
accept Stinger Venom | Puluu.
accept Lines of Communication
accept Natural Armor | Maktu.
turnin The Orebor Harborage
accept Ango'rosh Encroachment | Ikuti.
accept Daggerfen Deviance
complete Ango'rosh Encroachment | Ango'rosh ogres at the Twin Spire Ruins and the Ango'rosh Grounds.
complete Daggerfen Deviance | Daggerfen camp, north.
complete Stinger Venom | Marshlight Bleeders.
complete Lines of Communication
complete Natural Armor | Fenclaw Hide drops from Fenclaw Thrasher and Mragesh.
turnin Ango'rosh Encroachment
accept Overlord Gorefist
turnin Natural Armor
accept Maktu's Revenge
complete Overlord Gorefist | Ango'rosh Stronghold.
turnin Daggerfen Deviance
complete Maktu's Revenge
turnin Overlord Gorefist
turnin Maktu's Revenge
turnin Stinger Venom
turnin Lines of Communication
fp Orebor Harborage
level 63
note Ride south from Telredor into Terokkar Forest; Allerian Stronghold is the Alliance town. Shattrath City is on the way.
